{"reviews":[{"id":"B01448SZ0U-0","r":5.0,"t":"and it even comes in a pretty leather case to hold everything firmly","x":"I just got this delivered a few days ago. All of the instruments are high quality, and it even comes in a pretty leather case to hold everything firmly. Just the tweezer and mirror alone is worth the price.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2015"},{"id":"B01448SZ0U-1","r":5.0,"t":"Highly recommend","x":"Great item at a reasonable price.  Comes in a good easy to carry kit.  Tools are well made, easy to use and clean.  Worth the price.  Best extractor I have used.  Must have.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2016"},{"id":"B01448SZ0U-2","r":5.0,"t":"The product is of very good quality. Thanks","x":"My only complaint is that there are no instructions or descriptions of each tool.  That would be a plus. The product is of very good quality.  Thanks!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2016"},{"id":"B01448SZ0U-3","r":5.0,"t":"Quality Product","x":"Extremely Happy. Wife got this for me and several other dermatool products.  All of them are high quality.","h":2,"v":0,"d":"May 2016"},{"id":"B01448SZ0U-4","r":5.0,"t":"Worth it","x":"I've had kits &#34;like&#34; this before, but none of them came close to the professional quality Dermatools are made of---or the results I've gotten. I am much happier with this kit. Definitely worth getting if you suffer from comedone breakouts. It is a much more gentle, sufficient and CLEANER way of removing them than using your fingers.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2016"},{"id":"B01448SZ0U-5","r":5.0,"t":"There was an issue with receiving the product but Dermatool had excellent service recovery and I am quite pleased with t","x":"I purchased the dermatool products recently and have found them to be quite reliable and much easier to use than tools I have purchased in the past. There was an issue with receiving the product but Dermatool had excellent service recovery and I am quite pleased with their products and service.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2016"},{"id":"B01448SZ0U-6","r":5.0,"t":"Very satisfied with my DERMATOOL Comedone Extractor Kit","x":"Very satisfied with my DERMATOOL Comedone Extractor Kit. It was a relief to know that the tools could be cleaned with rubbing alcohol! I also liked the sturdy carrying case that is stylish and compact.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2016"},{"id":"B01448SZ0U-7","r":5.0,"t":"Great quality grooming tools","x":"I read a lot of the reviews and decided to buy this kit!  I'm glad I did!  This is perfect for men and women to use for personal grooming!  Tools are made well and great zip around case to keep it in!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2016"},{"id":"B01448SZ0U-8","r":5.0,"t":"Better then i thought","x":"I bought this feeling skeptical but after using this product I can say I'm very happy and all of the pieces are made of high quality materials and will last for a very long time","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2016"},{"id":"B01448SZ0U-9","r":5.0,"t":"Great Set","x":"Great product for the money.  Like another reviewer said, these are the best tweezers I have ever owned.  The other tools are high quality as well.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2016"},{"id":"B01448SZ0U-10","r":5.0,"t":"EXACTLY WHAT YOU NEED.....","x":"Great Product. Everything you need to be looking good. Wish I had this set when I was in High School. EXCELLENT!!!!!! 5 STARS!!!!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2016"},{"id":"B01448SZ0U-11","r":5.0,"t":"The Michael Jordan of tools.","x":"I give the product 5 stars. I have pimples everywhere. EVERYWHERE. So this is awsome. Tony Rice approved.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"May 2016"},{"id":"B01448SZ0U-12","r":5.0,"t":"Boring review but they're great.","x":"Excellent set of tools, best I've seen and at a great price.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2016"},{"id":"B01448SZ0U-13","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent tweezers","x":"Very good set. The tweezers alone are worth the price.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2016"},{"id":"B01448SZ0U-14","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"High quality product and great follow up service!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2016"},{"id":"B01448SZ0U-15","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"picking at my face has become a hobby with this","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B01448SZ0U-16","r":5.0,"t":"love it","x":"I wasn't sure what to expect, as I have never owned such a kit. But I really love it and it has done a great job helping me get rid of my blackheads. When I first got the kit, I was a little confused over which tool was appropriate for which type of blemish. I sent an email with that question to the company and in less than two hours got a detailed response, which also explained that I could get more info on youtube. Great product, great service.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2016"},{"id":"B01448SZ0U-17","r":5.0,"t":"Say \"adios\" to blackheads.","x":"This kit is amazing.  Truly a must have.  I tried for years to remove very small but visible and annoying blackheads to no avail.  Just one tool in this kit did the job so easily.  It has been several long weeks and I have not had the need to retouch.  This is a well made, great quality tool and the case is very well made and great quality as well.  I highly recommend it.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B01448SZ0U-18","r":5.0,"t":"Best value in skin improvement","x":"This is the best tool to help eradicate those pesky skin problems.  A tremendous value.  Would buy again without hesitation.  This would make a terrific gift for anyone.  I have a few recurring ingrown hairs, never have they been so easy to deal with.  I have been using a Tweezerman tool which is good but nowhere near as good as these tools. Superb.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2016"},{"id":"B01448SZ0U-19","r":4.0,"t":"DERMATOOL","x":"The tools are of high quality stainless steel and feel balanced in your hand. I am still learning how to work with them. Must admit, the learning process and end result is taking longer than expected.  Hoping that I will be able to get the  results needed.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2016"},{"id":"B01448SZ0U-20","r":5.0,"t":"Good value","x":"[[ASIN:B01448SZ0U Premium Comedone Extractor Acne Treatment Ingrown Hair Skin Care Kit Dermatologist & Esthetician Surgical Grade Skin Care w/Fine Tweezers,Magnifying Mirror,Pimples,Blemish,Whitehead, Blackheads]]  exactly as described , very nice set","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B01448SZ0U-21","r":4.0,"t":"Certified esthetician","x":"Very good kit. Wanted a extraction kit for work. It's been a nice addition to my facials. The only reason I did not give five stars is that the tools are a thicker medal then I've worked with before. So it's a little tougher to use. Other then that \ud83d\udc4d\ud83c\udffb","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B01448SZ0U-22","r":5.0,"t":"More than I wanted. Got exactly as described.","x":"Pretty nice for individual use.  The instruments feel well balanced in my hand.  Each tool is well polished, no sharp edges.  The tools can take far more than I can give them so I take Ibuprofen an hour before to make it alil easier on myself.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B01448SZ0U-23","r":5.0,"t":"Nice set.","x":"Nice set. But in reality I found that you only need one or two tools but the main question is which one are you most comfortable with? So if new like me, you have to get a big set to try it. Still, it's a good set at a great price.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2016"},{"id":"B01448SZ0U-24","r":4.0,"t":"Great quality tools","x":"Excellent tool set, it has simplified the extraction process tremendously. Great quality materials for the tools. Only gave 4 stars due to zipper on kit doesn't always work and tools fall out. But tools themselves are well made.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Nov 2016"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers consistently praise the high quality and durability of the tools.","cites":[1,2,3,4,5,8,9,10,13,15]},{"text":"Many reviewers say the kit is worth the price and a good value.","cites":[1,2,5,10,13,14]},{"text":"The sturdy, stylish carrying case is frequently mentioned as a plus.","cites":[1,2,7,8]},{"text":"Several reviewers single out the tweezers as especially excellent.","cites":[1,10,14]},{"text":"A few reviewers note the lack of instructions or tool descriptions as a drawback.","cites":[3]}]},"qa":[]}